<title>USA: HemaSure says patent lawsuit has no merit.</title>
<headline>HemaSure says patent lawsuit has no merit.</headline>
<dateline>MARLBOROUGH, Mass. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>HemaSure Inc said on Tuesday it believes its product, LeukoNet, does not infringe any valid patent rights and that the patent suit brought by Pall Corp on November 18 has no merit.</p>
<p>Pall said yesterday that its lawsuit alleges that HemaSure's leukocyte-reducing blood filters violate two U.S. patents covering Pall's nylon membrane and its leukocyte-reducing filter medium.</p>
</text>
